{"title": "Mind Sanctuary (area)", "pageid": 39990, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Mind_Sanctuary_(area)", "categories": ["Summoned areas", "Areas"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"min-height: 200px\" class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img alt=\"Mind Sanctuary (area) controller icon\" src=\"/w/images/1/1e/Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"144\" height=\"144\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1e/Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Mind Sanctuary</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Area\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">area</a> created by the tadpole ability <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Sanctuary\" title=\"Mind Sanctuary\">Mind Sanctuary</a>. It creates an area that allows creatures inside to use their actions and bonus actions interchangeably.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Anyone within the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Sanctuary\" title=\"Mind Sanctuary\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp/25px-Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp/38px-Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp/50px-Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mind Sanctuary\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp/25px-Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1e/Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Sanctuary\" title=\"Mind Sanctuary\">Mind Sanctuary</a> can take actions and bonus actions interchangeably.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Type: <a href=\"/wiki/Area#Summoned\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">Summoned</a></dd>\n\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary\"> Condition: Within the Mind Sanctuary </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_(Condition)\" title=\"Within the Mind Sanctuary (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Within the Mind Sanctuary\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Within_the_Mind_Sanctuary_(Condition)\" title=\"Within the Mind Sanctuary (Condition)\">Within the Mind Sanctuary</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity can take actions and bonus actions interchangeably, as long as it stays within the mind sanctuary.</li>\n<li>After using both action and bonus action, this condition ends and you gain the <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Sanctuary:_Depleted_(Condition)\" title=\"Mind Sanctuary: Depleted (Condition)\">Mind Sanctuary: Depleted</a> condition.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creation\">Creation</span></h2>\n<p>This area can be created by the following:\n</p><p>\nSpells and actions:\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Sanctuary\" title=\"Mind Sanctuary\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp/30px-Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp/45px-Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp/60px-Mind_San